          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147898,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir diziyi envanter çubuğu gibi düşün. Bir yuva, <code>100</code> gibi bir dizeyi, boolean değeri veya sayıyı; kısacası herhangi bir değişkeni ya da değeri depolayabilir.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;100&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>100</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147899,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir dizideki her öğenin index adı verilen numaralandırılmış bir konumu vardır.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147900,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İndeksler 0'dan başlar ve sonraki her değerle birlikte artar. Bu, <code>playerStats</code> içindeki ikinci öğenin <code>1</code> indeksinde olduğu anlamına gelir. Bu indeksi koduna ekle.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats[\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>1</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147901,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>true</code> değeri gibi bir öğeye erişmek için dizi adı olan <code>playerStats</code>'i, köşeli parantezler arasındaki öğenin diziniyle <code>[2]</code> birlikte yaz.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"72\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>playerStats</code>, ardından <code>[</code> ve sonra <code>2</code>, <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147902,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İkinci indeksteki değeri güncellemek için <code>playerStats[2]</code> üzerinden ona eriş, ardından <code>=</code> kullanarak <code>false</code> gibi yeni bir değer ata.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option startIndex=\"62\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerStats[\" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>playerStats[2]</code>, ardından <code>=</code> ve son olarak <code>false</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147903,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dizide dört öğe olmasına rağmen erişebileceğimiz son indeks <code>3</code>'tür; çünkü indeksleme 0'dan başlar.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"61\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerStats = [\" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;warrior&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"playerStats[\" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;mage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerStats);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>3</code> öğesini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
